# Vocabulary, one word per line. Sourced from ur.dic in the UrduDictionary
# extension redistributed as hunspell-ur (LGPL-2.1-or-later, so GPL-3.0
# compatible): every one- and two-character entry plus a systematic 1-in-N
# sample of the whole list, unioned with every token of the other ur/*.lst
# files, misspellings included. Harakat, hamza and madda are kept as found;
# Urdu ہ ی ک ے are not Arabic ه ي ك and both forms appear here on purpose.
